SUMMARY:The Conjurer: An Intimate Magical Experience with Master Magician C
	urt Miller in Sugar Land
DTSTAMP:20260731T111644Z
DTSTART:20260801T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Conjurer: An Intimate Magical Experience with Master Magici
	an Curt Miller returns for 3 live\, family-friendly shows at Houston Marri
	ott Sugar Land. \nThe intimate magical experience features amazing close-u
	p magic\, clean comedy\, audience interaction\, theatrical lighting\, musi
	c and video in a vintage magic theater atmosphere— making it a great date 
	night or friends night out. \nThe interactive show includes an incredible 
	trick you will perform yourself. \nAdmission\nTickets range from $55 to $9
	0. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sp
	onsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and
	 more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, bu
	siness\, or offer across all of our channels\n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston
	.com/calendar/the-conjurer-an-intimate-magical-experience-with-master-magi
	cian-curt-miller-in-sugar-land-2026-3/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
