IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/07/Launch-Kit-One-Piece-4th-Anniversary-OP17-PRe-Rele
 ase-Event.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07
 /Launch-Kit-One-Piece-4th-Anniversary-OP17-PRe-Release-Event.png
UID:_kmWmyzaIBorblPYQtPC_
SUMMARY:One Piece: 4th Anniversary OP17  Pre-Release
DTSTAMP:20260731T111644Z
DTSTART:20260821T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:🏴‍☠️ Celebrate four years of the One Piece Card Game with CCS Hous
	ton at the OP-17 4th Anniversary Pre-Release Event! Hosted by Luffy’s Corn
	er\nBe among the first players to crack open the newest set\, build your d
	eck on the spot\, and battle fellow pirates for exclusive pre-release priz
	es. Whether you’re chasing new leaders\, testing fresh strategies\, or jus
	t excited to experience the set before official release\, this is the perf
	ect chance to jump in with the community. \nThis event is capped at 32 pla
	yers\, so reserve your spot before it fills! \n  \n🗓️ Date: August 21\, 202
	6 \n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet St #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n  \n📝 Event
	 Overview:\n\nFormat: Standard\nTournament Structure: Sealed\nExpected Num
	ber of Rounds: 3\nPlayer Capacity: 32\nEntry Fee: $40\nSign Up: On-Site\nP
	layers get 6 packs to build their decks\n\n  \n💰 Prize Pool:\n\n1st Place:
	 Store Tournament Winner Pack\nParticipation: Participation Pack\nYou get 
	to keep what you pull from the packs you open!\n\nBandai participation + w
	inner pack \n  \n📋 Registration Details:\n\nDoors Open: 3:00 PM\nOn-Site R
