SUMMARY:Community Conversation Volunteer Shift
DTSTAMP:20260731T111644Z
DTSTART:20260923T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join a truly unique volunteer shift where neighbors\, community
	 leaders\, and food bank staff come together to share experiences and brid
	ge mutual understanding. The gathering is highly interactive and uses stru
	ctured conversations to build stronger and more connected communities. Whe
	ther you join individually or as a group\, this experience moves beyond fo
